# Real business documents used for local doc-parsing tests — never commit
/*.pdf

# Sep 14 L5: transfer-resident kit — prevent accidental staging.
# The kit ships as tarball/zip, never as repo-tracked files.
PORTABLE_AGENT_KIT/

# PORTABLE_AGENT_KIT quarantine — the kit is a transfer/resume
# carrier for this repo, NEVER an Integrated-OS artifact; it ships
# only as a tarball, never via git (Sep 14 incident: 145 kit files
# nearly swept into one atomic commit by a broad git add).
PORTABLE_AGENT_KIT/
